(Vendor Risk Summary) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(This document summarises the risk assessment for third-party) Tj T*
(processors used by the Platform Engineering group. It is reviewed) Tj T*
(each quarter by the Security Office and the Data Protection Officer.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Tiering) Tj T*
(Vendors are placed in one of three tiers. Tier 1 vendors process) Tj T*
(Restricted data and require an annual on-site assessment. Tier 2) Tj T*
(vendors process Internal data and require a security questionnaire) Tj T*
(every two years. Tier 3 vendors receive no company data and require) Tj T*
(only a signed terms of service.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
