(Assessment findings) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The primary cloud hosting vendor is Tier 1 and holds a current) Tj T*
(independent audit report. No critical findings are open.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The analytics vendor is Tier 2. Its questionnaire from the previous) Tj T*
(cycle lapsed in March, so a renewal is outstanding. Until the) Tj T*
(questionnaire is renewed, no new data may be shared with that vendor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Continuous monitoring) Tj T*
(Security ratings for all Tier 1 and Tier 2 vendors are monitored) Tj T*
(monthly. A drop in rating below the acceptable threshold opens an) Tj T*
(automatic review ticket assigned to the vendor owner.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
