() Tj T*
(A vendor with an open critical finding must produce a remediation) Tj T*
(plan within 10 business days. If the plan is rejected, the vendor is) Tj T*
(suspended: existing integrations are switched to read-only and new) Tj T*
(data flows are blocked.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Termination of a vendor relationship requires confirmation that all) Tj T*
(company data has been deleted or returned, evidenced in writing, and) Tj T*
(recorded in the vendor register.) Tj T*
